-----
Generated

Monitoring:
-----------
Improved

Summary
=======

Problem:
Attackers can change their MAC address and impersonate legitimate devices.

Solution:
Use Port Security and Device Tracking to detect duplicate or suspicious MAC address activity.

Benefit:
Improves visibility and helps identify MAC impersonation attempts.

Limitation:
Attackers may still attempt CAM table attacks.

